flowchart LR
    User[Operator / Creator] --> Dashboard[Dashboard UI]
    Dashboard --> Auth[Dashboard Auth / Authorization]
    Auth --> DeployReq[Deploy Request]
    DeployReq --> API[Host Deployment API]

    API --> Validate[Validate Request]
    Validate --> Choice{Space Type}

    Choice -->|Unity| UnityTemplate[Unity Template Provisioner]
    Choice -->|Hyperfy| HyperfyTemplate[Hyperfy Template Provisioner]

    UnityTemplate --> UnityFiles[Build / Copy Unity Artifacts]
    UnityTemplate --> UnityConfig[Generate Unity Runtime Config]
    HyperfyTemplate --> HyperfyInstance[Provision Hyperfy Instance / Directory]
    HyperfyTemplate --> HyperfyConfig[Generate Hyperfy Env / Runtime Config]

    UnityFiles --> DNS[Create / Update DNS Record]
    UnityConfig --> DNS
    HyperfyInstance --> DNS
    HyperfyConfig --> DNS

    DNS --> ProxyTemplate{Proxy Type}
    ProxyTemplate -->|Static Unity| UnityProxy[Generate Unity Nginx Config]
    ProxyTemplate -->|Hyperfy Node| HyperfyProxy[Generate Hyperfy Nginx Config]

    UnityProxy --> Enable[Write sites-available and symlink sites-enabled]
    HyperfyProxy --> Enable

    Enable --> Test[Run nginx -t]
    Test -->|Pass| Reload[Reload Nginx]
    Test -->|Fail| Rollback[Abort / Rollback / Report Error]

    Reload --> Verify[Verify Public URL + Health]
    Verify --> Status[Return Status / Logs / URL]
    Rollback --> Status
    Status --> Dashboard
